      "side": 1,
      "message": "This does fit onto a single line of 100 but pylint (as enforced by repo presubmit hooks) enforces it to be 80 characters wide, http://cs/android/tools/repohooks/tools/pylintrc?l\u003d285.\n\nPersonally, I would prefer 100 wide, I find 80 wide with a 4 character indent quite restrictive but I am just trying to follow the \"standard\" enforced by repo presubmit so that these scripts will work if/when we turn on pylint enforcement.\n\nWhile investigating this I realized that I was too lenient and removed pylint comments that disabled line length checks over the whole of this test. I added them because I thought that pylint reported line length issues with multi line strings but that does not appear to be true.",
